            <div xml:id="m-fe156966-499f-4e49-a7c2-78def9dc343f">
              <lg xml:id="m-2e1c776b-beb9-4e18-98e9-fe307cebdd5d">
                <l xml:id="m-1e1d38b4-5ecc-4664-a4c2-cb5a5e53ab2e" facs="#m-a65c2351-3b18-4a8a-8400-be76b657af80" label="ambiguous">502</l><l xml:id="m-4578eac9-8402-45ee-8db8-0acdd2dfd133" facs="#m-355f84f1-2ddf-460e-badb-9563e225fe8b" label="text-like">Septuagesima Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-535ec1de-a144-4800-a58c-58ff2cce8317" facs="#m-653d761a-a9e5-4d79-be80-a9198521503a" label="ambiguous">Second Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-6de63625-42e9-4a0a-aea4-c74d313abd9a" facs="#m-36d4bfae-2642-41d4-8244-e3d1691fbed3" label="lyrics-like">Undet et múniat nos, quaésu-lApóstolis tuis Petro et Paulo, atque</l><l xml:id="m-335525a4-cdfe-4d67-9b8a-b18d114d2c0c" facs="#m-48f7c039-981b-47c3-ab46-5ba973b1bbde" label="lyrics-like">JAL mus Dómine, divini sacra¬</l><l xml:id="m-1f2277a2-607a-4a0d-a31b-4fb1935cdd7e" facs="#m-21b976f3-3805-4911-a568-042aff2ab3cd" label="lyrics-like">beâto N. et ómnibus Sanctis: a</l><l xml:id="m-86f20888-45df-429a-a03e-4adc55eb700b" facs="#m-1c7fe4c5-d275-4542-a65f-ada3538f8334" label="lyrics-like">ménti munus oblátum: et interce¬</l><l xml:id="m-a9118316-2dfd-4113-ae85-340eb4b8d88b" facs="#m-7e58f072-e306-454a-b9ab-02b3a7ac5083" label="lyrics-like">cunctis nos reddat et perversitáti¬</l><l xml:id="m-dcd98a7d-de90-49d6-84b0-2d0b36f72150" facs="#m-44c10bfa-a991-4fcd-a8b8-295ccec1bf46" label="lyrics-like">dénte beáta Virgine Dei Genitrice] bus expiãtos, et adversitátibus ex¬</l><l xml:id="m-79c0e551-6608-457d-a3c7-2d901c2eaaa2" facs="#m-521f85bd-6662-4fd4-bed0-11cc2cff2dc8" label="lyrics-like">Maria, cum beáto Joseph, beátis! peditos. (Per Dóminum.)</l><l xml:id="m-83d3e775-a2bb-4074-8e3a-f4ff06094ce0" facs="#m-ef93d5d6-a225-4abc-a8ca-175304543085" label="text-like">Third at the priest's choice.</l><l xml:id="m-c851851e-c6c5-4e56-946c-bae34f63172c" facs="#m-588e52de-4c8c-4fab-97c1-c692f0bc7cf4" label="text-like">Before the Purifleatlon, second Postcommunion of Our Lady. Hacc</l><l xml:id="m-0e16f3f0-743f-42c3-89a9-eac5be8e831d" facs="#m-db5074ce-209f-4f0d-a3f2-bb5a83324e75" label="text-like">nos. p. 442. Third for the Church or for the Pope, p. 823.</l><l xml:id="m-07b2e72b-8859-4359-acbe-aaf53a09a743" facs="#m-1684be55-1dd9-41fc-bc4a-2e002958e86f" label="lyrics-like">v. Benedicámus Dómino. K. Déo grátias.</l><l xml:id="m-918275fd-743c-4a2f-938f-c814a1377b6e" facs="#m-52bf54bd-5d26-45b4-b28b-a9ceff51dfe1" label="text-like">AT SEXT.</l><l xml:id="m-5324da8c-e528-4346-a340-3f1d514cf3fb" facs="#m-e7a4cd03-fc57-40ca-aef2-612164283cae" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-8e498785-0a3e-42b0-9429-54475584e2c0" facs="#m-8089421e-8bab-46d0-ba38-afceb0125807" label="ambiguous">1.g</l><l xml:id="m-aed38ac4-56c4-459e-99d2-bf39f44e2507" facs="#m-d82167d2-f369-4a41-b7e1-ae0ec94de749" label="lyrics-like">Uid hic stá-tis"a di--?Respondé¬</l><l xml:id="m-26ca22ad-297a-4a33-8c31-0692bca2ce60" facs="#m-36f2754e-d35b-4265-afc9-7d855ee343ee" label="lyrics-like">runt, et dixé-runt: Némo nos condú-xit. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-bd31b5ad-3e03-49bb-ad03-d10e61872708" facs="#m-d5bebf47-c3ec-4eb7-97e9-593b0602f485" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-b0e54a8c-e05b-4a61-af7d-5e7c61b8e245" facs="#m-2cdbe3c8-c63c-4bb2-b6b4-0366e3821e66" label="ambiguous">1 Cor. 9. d.</l><l xml:id="m-4e3b7b47-93e7-447b-9d62-b7e950c8db76" facs="#m-320ce5d8-2450-4b17-adb1-c0429d9e2f7f" label="lyrics-like">Mnis autem qui in agóne con-[rónam accípiant, *nos autem in¬</l><l xml:id="m-75fe16ee-9f24-4ae3-8fd9-bbb73e7ee39e" facs="#m-c4010e45-a0fe-4c30-baf9-cc14e7e8cc7d" label="lyrics-like">U téndit, ab ómnibus se ábstinet:t</l><l xml:id="m-396c16af-06a4-42cd-93ba-dc35e0196188" facs="#m-746cea07-686b-472b-a735-e71938256dae" label="lyrics-like">corrúptam.</l><l xml:id="m-a66f1746-0f09-4d64-ae56-de95fe4fe9c1" facs="#m-46566313-10a0-44d1-9612-7721a1584582" label="ambiguous">et illi quidem ut corruptibilem co¬</l><l xml:id="m-e2ae440a-8e81-42fe-816c-fea2a0b65a8b" facs="#m-f302007d-ecbc-41d1-b10e-7e9d3e4b164a" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. In aetérnum Dómine. V. Dóminus régit me. p. 243.</l><l xml:id="m-5e766c6a-ceab-404c-9ea3-50c10b98e16c" facs="#m-f755f06f-79b2-47a1-ba70-81678389a190" label="text-like">AT NONE.</l><l xml:id="m-fb37af9c-9fae-4126-b4c0-36ed838c9a9d" facs="#m-7de65aae-e9c6-4147-91d8-af0090135b08" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-73db2bbe-678b-488c-a3d6-df51f0fb400a" facs="#m-52f753ea-e590-4451-8776-063a68741f75" label="ambiguous">s. d.</l><l xml:id="m-0658f97a-632e-4780-9683-ad42d7ebda90" facs="#m-efa35219-72c1-459a-b274-4e9525651d95" label="lyrics-like">Oca o-perá-ri-o,"et rédde illis mercédem</l><l xml:id="m-70af112b-11ec-4e28-aec9-ff56f6c12db3" facs="#m-6954eb2c-2a28-4ccc-a2ee-2263b2019762" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-a225b62a-4acc-4f2c-b171-a7fe43d8d600" facs="#m-85372faf-6cf0-4c3d-9fe7-d862f7f9fae9" label="lyrics-like">sú-am, dí-cit Dóminus. E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-1b1912ac-5b91-41f6-ad43-b70b037f83bd" facs="#m-f63d03f3-6e7e-494c-9939-de58555fc414" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-82d7060e-9dff-46b1-9390-c821b94b0236" facs="#m-ab495780-7f63-44f0-8cfa-b0df577a1517" label="ambiguous">1Cor. 10.</l><l xml:id="m-92c6cfa6-850f-4f7c-aae4-1464230e0691" facs="#m-53e5b660-a2d2-4591-ac9a-5ef63c0d1646" label="lyrics-like">QIbébant autem de spiritáli, con¬ tem erat Christus:* sed non in plú¬</l><l xml:id="m-6d87398b-d11f-4e22-954a-df7596eb14f9" facs="#m-1f2568b6-efbf-4ed3-92e4-ec8106a095a3" label="lyrics-like">D sequénte eos, petra :t petra au- ribus eórum beneplácitum est Deo.</l><l xml:id="m-fe53b58d-f06a-465e-99d2-fd6e8fd878a8" facs="#m-44999b9d-4993-4ad8-b698-f0e1019d7f12" label="lyrics-like">Short Resp. Clamávi in tóto córde. V. Ab occúltis. p. 247.</l><l xml:id="m-39e3958f-6d81-4bbd-956b-935693057dcf" facs="#m-6edf2f46-0708-438d-93b3-2c32e77adef5" label="text-like">AT VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-53cbed9a-1e3a-4d74-bf1d-6ac1dfdf1468" facs="#m-3b7a3587-41ba-41a5-bbe0-de7680cfe5a0" label="text-like">Antiphons and Psalms of the Sunday, p. 251.</l><l xml:id="m-311f43f7-f863-474d-9455-b367143fd675" facs="#m-3d5170af-6433-405f-b911-b6764de7e01d" label="ambiguous">Chapter.</l><l xml:id="m-039247c6-851b-448b-be85-bafdfe9027af" facs="#m-c7922ee7-c359-46b3-8ba7-c165a5811d2d" label="ambiguous">1Cor. 9. d.</l><l xml:id="m-9e0917db-5f98-40ad-a0cb-589878ca0520" facs="#m-c8be3992-a00c-4e50-a69b-44266d63d20e" label="lyrics-like">yRatres: Nescitis quod ii qui in l currunt, sed unus áccipit bravíum?</l><l xml:id="m-30aae207-a27e-4c6a-8a57-bde59afc8800" facs="#m-92068d88-a5a2-4525-889d-83cf0a3130ee" label="lyrics-like">stádio currunt, t omnes quidem lSic cúrrite ut comprehendáti¬.</l><l xml:id="m-2250e9b0-b794-4ac5-b307-cd2ee639361a" facs="#m-49b05590-86ef-4b88-a6af-207cd2df1ef4" label="lyrics-like">Hymn. Lúcis Creátor. p. 256. V. Dirigátur.</l></lg>
